5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-10T09:26:11-08:00","id":1060905,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nonsense</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1001149-extending-life?p=1060890#post1060890\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I posted as a response to the \u201cmagick is either vulgar or not, there is no scaling\u201c, to show that there are at least 3 different levels of vulgar magick.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh Sorry. So that's like: Vulgar; Time Travel Backwards Vulgar; &amp; What's the other one?<br /> Also, on an unrelated note, it's funny that quotation marks come out weird on this forum when anyone quotes them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-10T11:11:29-08:00","id":1060943,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spacecat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1001149-extending-life?p=1060905#post1060905\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh Sorry. So that's like: Vulgar; Time Travel Backwards Vulgar; &amp; What's the other one?<br /> Also, on an unrelated note, it's funny that quotation marks come out weird on this forum when anyone quotes them.</div> </div> </div> </div>I thought: normal Paradox, Layers of Paradox, and Permadox.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>So, this Zen Master walks up to a hot dog stand and says: &quot;Make me one with everything!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12022-nonsense","name":"Nonsense","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12022_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"815"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-10T12:45:14-08:00","id":1060984,"title":"","content":"I guess that's one way to look at it. I've always thought of gaining permadox and gaining layers of paradox as distinct variants of gaining paradox rather than different points on a scale but I get what you mean.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}